    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/adcb3ea0-132d-4e4a-8877-3d9ead63f083-image.png\" style=\"width: 295px; height: 225px;\" /></p><p>plane <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi></math></p><p>Mid-point&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi><mo>&#8801;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo></math>&nbsp;lies on plane</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn></math></p><p>Direction ratios of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;is parallel to the normal vector of plane.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo>